<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever 9-mth net profit NLG 3.06 billion.</title>
<headline>Unilever 9-mth net profit NLG 3.06 billion.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months of 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)	  10.90   vs   10.85</p>
<p>    Net profit/current exchange rates     3,062  vs    3,035</p>
<p>    Net profit/constant exchange rates    3,001  vs    3,030</p>
<p>    Turnover				     63,831  vs   59,261</p>
<p>    Operating profit			    5,390  vs    5,229</p>
<p>    Income from fixed investments		47  vs	 73</p>
<p>    Interest charges				500  vs	482</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				4,937  vs    4,820</p>
<p>    Tax					     1,778  vs    1,680</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit			     3,159  vs    3,140</p>
<p>    Minority interests (loss)		   158  vs(loss)110</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
